# Agent worktrees. A Claude Code agent given an isolated worktree gets one
# under .claude/worktrees/, inside this repository -- and a worktree has
# its own bazel-* convenience symlinks pointing into Bazel's external
# tree. `bazel build //...` follows them and fails loading a package it
# has no business seeing, so a contributor running agents in worktrees
# cannot build at all until this directory is ignored. Found exactly that
# way.
.claude
